; The exports of d3d9.dll (ReactOS 0.4.16, i386: Wine's d3d9 over wined3d,
; d3dwine.dll, over opengl32.dll's Mesa) that the Win32 test programs call,
; for their import library (`cargo xtask` builds it with dlltool --kill-at).
; A program that imports it brings d3d9, d3dwine and opengl32 to the boot
; disk through the import closure.
LIBRARY d3d9.dll
EXPORTS
Direct3DCreate9@4
